{"seq":3,"slug":"extended-stats-estimation-bias","title":"扩展统计、表达式统计与估算偏差诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/extended-stats-estimation-bias","wordCount":2729,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"扩展统计-表达式统计与估算偏差诊断\">扩展统计、表达式统计与估算偏差诊断</h1><p>电商查询里最贵的一类估算错误不是&quot;多估了 20%&quot;，而是<strong>把 1 行估成 100000 行，或反过来</strong>——前者让规划器放弃索引做全表扫描，后者让它对一张大表选 Nested Loop，一次错误就把查询从 5ms 拖到 40s。这类量级偏差几乎从不来自单列摘要本身（见同章 <code>./1_pg-statistic-mcv-histogram.md</code>），而是来自规划器默认假设的两条&quot;不成立的前提&quot;：<strong>列与列之间相互独立</strong>，以及<strong>统计只认识裸列、不认识由列计算出来的表达式</strong>。本文属于「统计信息与代价模型」章节，讲 PostgreSQL 用哪些机制去补这两条前提，以及补不上时如何把偏差定位到具体节点。版本事实以 PostgreSQL 全球开发组发布的官方文档与发布说明为准（PG 18 于 2025-09-25 发布，PG 17 于 2024-09-26、PG 16 于 2023-09-14 发布，<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/release/</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类扩展统计与表达式的两种落地\">核心概念：三类扩展统计与表达式的两种落地</h2><p><code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 在 PG 10 首次出现时只带 <code>dependencies</code> 与 <code>ndistinct</code> 两种&quot;kind&quot;，PG 12（2019-10-03）补上 <code>mcv</code>，PG 14（2021-09-30）再把统计对象的定义范围从&quot;列&quot;扩展到&quot;表达式&quot;（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-createstatistics.html</code>）。三条时间线对应三种不同的估算失败模式，用途并不重叠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>kind</th>\n<th>存什么</th>\n<th>服务的查询形状</th>\n<th>典型失效场景</th>\n<th>是否覆盖范围条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>dependencies</code></td>\n<td>列间函数依赖度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多个等值条件的组合</td>\n<td>强相关列被当作独立相乘</td>\n<td>否，仅等值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ndistinct</code></td>\n<td>列组联合去重基数</td>\n<td><code>GROUP BY a,b</code>、连接基数</td>\n<td>分组数被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_a \\times n_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高估</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mcv</code></td>\n<td>多列值组合的高频列表</td>\n<td>等值条件覆盖列组子集</td>\n<td>高频组合被独立公式低估</td>\n<td>否，仅等值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的入口是同一处：<code>ANALYZE</code> 在采样后为每个统计对象计算摘要，写入 <code>pg_statistic_ext_data</code>（PG 12 起把&quot;定义&quot;与&quot;数据&quot;拆成两张目录表，正是为了不让扩展统计里可能含真实值的高频列表落到普通用户可读的目录中）。可读视图是 <code>pg_stats_ext</code>，表达式统计另有 <code>pg_stats_ext_exprs</code>（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/view-pg-stats-ext.html</code>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[CREATE STATISTICS&lt;br/&gt;仅注册定义, 不产出数据] --&gt; B[ANALYZE 采样该表]&#10;    B --&gt; C{统计对象的 kind}&#10;    C --&gt;|dependencies| D[统计列间函数依赖度 d]&#10;    C --&gt;|ndistinct| E[统计列组联合去重基数]&#10;    C --&gt;|mcv| F[构建多列值组合高频表]&#10;    D --&gt; G[pg_statistic_ext_data]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[规划器估行器]&#10;    H --&gt; I{WHERE 等值条件&lt;br/&gt;是否覆盖列组子集?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[用扩展统计修正选择率]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[退回单列相乘的独立假设]\">flowchart TD\n    A[CREATE STATISTICS&lt;br/&gt;仅注册定义, 不产出数据] --&gt; B[ANALYZE 采样该表]\n    B --&gt; C{统计对象的 kind}\n    C --&gt;|dependencies| D[统计列间函数依赖度 d]\n    C --&gt;|ndistinct| E[统计列组联合去重基数]\n    C --&gt;|mcv| F[构建多列值组合高频表]\n    D --&gt; G[pg_statistic_ext_data]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[规划器估行器]\n    H --&gt; I{WHERE 等值条件&lt;br/&gt;是否覆盖列组子集?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[用扩展统计修正选择率]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[退回单列相乘的独立假设]</pre><p>一个立刻可用的判据：<code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 只是&quot;注册&quot;，<strong>不产出任何数据</strong>；没跑过 <code>ANALYZE</code> 的统计对象在规划器眼里等于不存在。<code>pg_stats_ext</code> 中某行若各摘要列（<code>dependencies</code>、<code>most_common_vals</code>、<code>n_distinct</code>）全为 NULL 或空数组，通常就是&quot;建了但没 ANALYZE&quot;或&quot;该列组没有统计到有意义的相关性&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dependencies-把函数依赖翻译成选择率折扣\">dependencies：把函数依赖翻译成选择率折扣</h2><p>最经典的失败案例在跨境电商里随处可见：<code>WHERE country = &#39;SG&#39; AND city = &#39;Singapore&#39;</code>。规划器假设两列独立，估行是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{country} \\times S_{city}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。如果 SG 的订单有 98% 落在 Singapore，两个单列选择率大约都是 0.05，乘积把结果压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0025</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05 \\times 0.05 = 0.0025</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0025</span></span></span></span></span>，而真实的联合选择率约为 0.05——<strong>低估 20 倍</strong>。低估会让规划器以为这个条件能立刻筛出几行，从而选择 Nested Loop 去驱动外层大表。</p>\n<p><code>dependencies</code> kind 存储的是一个方向性的函数依赖度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（列 1 决定列 2 的程度），估行时把独立假设向&quot;完全依赖&quot;方向插值（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/planner-statistics.html</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = s_1 \\cdot \\bigl(d + (1 - d)\\cdot s_2\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1 s_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（独立，与旧行为一致）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（完全依赖，第二个条件不增加选择性）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.98</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0.98</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.98</span></span></span></span></span> 的实测依赖度会把上面那个 20 倍低估修正回 1 倍附近。方向性很重要：<code>dependencies</code> 只在&quot;被依赖列的条件&quot;与&quot;依赖列的条件&quot;同时出现在 WHERE 中时才生效，也就是说查询必须把两个列都写了。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE STATISTICS s_order_geo (dependencies) ON country, city FROM orders;&#10;ANALYZE orders;&#10;SELECT dependencies FROM pg_stats_ext WHERE statistics_name = &#39;s_order_geo&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATISTICS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_order_geo (dependencies) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country, city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dependencies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stats_ext </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's_order_geo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>dependencies</code> 是<strong>成对</strong>统计的：一个对象里包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 列时，目录里会有至多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n(n-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 组有向依赖对，每对只有依赖度超过内部过滤阈值的才被保留。因此&quot;给三列建一个对象&quot;常比&quot;建三个两两对象&quot;更划算——一次采样同时估所有对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ndistinct-与-mcv-分组基数与多列高频组合\">ndistinct 与 mcv：分组基数与多列高频组合</h2><p><code>ndistinct</code> 解决<strong>虚高</strong>问题。<code>GROUP BY shop_id, channel</code> 的组数若按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{shop} \\times n_{channel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hann</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 估会远大于真实值，进而把排序/哈希聚合代价估高、把连接基数估偏高。<code>ndistinct</code> kind 直接存储该列组的联合去重基数，规划器在 <code>GROUP BY</code> 覆盖统计对象全部列时直接取用，也用在<strong>多列等值连接</strong>的输出行数估计上。</p>\n<p><code>mcv</code> kind 处理&quot;高频<strong>组合</strong>&quot;。上面的 <code>country</code>/<code>city</code> 例子用依赖度就能概括，但现实数据常是<strong>共现偏斜</strong>而非函数依赖：<code>shop_id = 1001 AND payment_status = &#39;paid&#39;</code> 可能因为这家店几乎不发 COD 订单，而比独立假设高两个数量级。多列 MCV 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1001</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>’paid’</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1001, \\text{&#x27;paid&#x27;})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1001</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">’paid’</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这样的<strong>值对</strong>当成统计单位记录频率，估行时先查高频表，命中取实测频率，未命中再退回依赖/独立公式。</p>\n<p>三类 kind 的选型规则可以压成一句：等值条件的<strong>组合</strong>过滤用 <code>mcv</code>；列间有<strong>方向性决定关系</strong>导致相乘虚高用 <code>dependencies</code>；<code>GROUP BY</code> 组数或<strong>连接基数</strong>需要联合去重基数用 <code>ndistinct</code>。三者都只对<strong>等值条件</strong>生效（<code>=</code>、<code>IN</code>），范围条件（<code>&lt;</code>、<code>BETWEEN</code>）不会触发扩展统计修正，仍走单列直方图——因此 <code>WHERE country=&#39;SG&#39; AND created_at &gt;= &#39;2026-09-01&#39;</code> 这类混合条件只可能被修正一半，这也是 PG 扩展统计与商业数据库&quot;多列直方图&quot;能力的主要差距。</p>\n<p>每个统计对象可以有自己的采样目标，PG 13（2020-09-24）起用 <code>ALTER STATISTICS ... SET STATISTICS</code> 单独调整，未设置时继承 <code>default_statistics_target = 100</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER STATISTICS s_order_geo SET STATISTICS 1000;&#10;ANALYZE orders;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATISTICS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_order_geo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATISTICS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE orders;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"表达式统计-从表达式索引到-pg-14-的扩展统计表达式\">表达式统计：从表达式索引到 PG 14 的扩展统计表达式</h2><p>第二类&quot;规划器看不见的东西&quot;是表达式。<code>WHERE lower(buyer_email) = &#39;a@shop.com&#39;</code> 或 <code>WHERE total_amount * 1.13 &gt; 500</code> 里的条件，其左值<strong>不是任何一列</strong>，<code>pg_statistic</code> 里没有对应条目，规划器只能退回到一个粗糙的内置默认（一般是固定选择率 0.5%），这个数字与真实命中率毫无关系。</p>\n<p>在 PG 14 之前，唯一手段是建<strong>表达式索引</strong>：<code>ANALYZE</code> 会为表达式索引收集与普通列同样的摘要，规划器在遇到与索引表达式<strong>逐字匹配</strong>的条件时就能用上。代价是必须真建一个索引（写放大、磁盘、维护），哪怕只是想让规划器知道答案。PG 14 把这项能力单独摘了出来：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE STATISTICS s_order_expr (dependencies)&#10;    ON (lower(buyer_email)), (total_amount * 1.13) FROM orders;&#10;ANALYZE orders;&#10;SELECT statistics_name, expression, n_distinct&#10;    FROM pg_stats_ext_exprs WHERE statistics_name = &#39;s_order_expr&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATISTICS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_order_expr (dependencies)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buyer_email)), (total_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics_name, expression, n_distinct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stats_ext_exprs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's_order_expr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些约束值得记住：表达式必须<strong>不可变（immutable）</strong>（<code>now()</code>、<code>random()</code> 这类会立即失真）；可以引用同一行的多列，但只能引用<strong>本表</strong>列；可与普通列混在同一对象里，从而让 <code>dependencies</code> 跨越&quot;列与表达式&quot;（例如 <code>lower(country)</code> 与 <code>city</code>）。</p>\n<p>表达式的<strong>逐字匹配</strong>语义容易被低估：<code>lower(email)</code> 的统计对 <code>upper(email)</code> 无用，对 <code>email ILIKE &#39;a%&#39;</code> 也无用——后者根本不是等值条件，规划器会用 <code>LIKE</code>/正则专用的固定选择率估算。PostgreSQL 没有覆盖 <code>ILIKE</code> 前缀的统计，只能靠 <code>pg_trgm</code> 之类的索引方案从另一条路解决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"估算偏差诊断-从-explain-差异到归因路径\">估算偏差诊断：从 EXPLAIN 差异到归因路径</h2><p>诊断目标不是&quot;让估算等于实际&quot;，而是<strong>把偏差归因到可修的根因</strong>。基准做法是 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code>，逐节点比较 <code>rows=</code>（估算）与 <code>actual rows=</code>（实际），并用 <strong>q-error</strong> 量化偏差（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-explain.html</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mtext>-error</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>rows</mtext><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>rows</mtext><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mtext>rows</mtext><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>rows</mtext><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q\\text{-error} = \\max\\!\\left(\\frac{\\text{rows}_{est}}{\\text{rows}_{act}},\\ \\frac{\\text{rows}_{act}}{\\text{rows}_{est}}\\right) \\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-error</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rows</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rows</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rows</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rows</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>q-error 的用处在于它是<strong>对称的</strong>：估 100 行实际 1 行、估 1 行实际 100 行，两者都是 100，而线性误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(est - act)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 会把前者当成&quot;没问题&quot;。对优化器估算质量的系统性研究（Leis 等人，VLDB 2015，<code>http://www.vldb.org/pvldb/vol9/p204-leis.pdf</code>）指出：严重估算错误<strong>大量集中在少数&quot;难查询&quot;上</strong>，且会沿连接树向上传播——底层几倍偏差经几层连接可放大成几个数量级，最终导致计划翻转。由此推出的诊断顺序是<strong>自底向上</strong>：先修叶子节点选择率，再谈连接顺序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[EXPLAIN ANALYZE&lt;br/&gt;逐节点算 q-error] --&gt; B{q-error 最大的节点在哪一层?}&#10;    B --&gt;|叶子扫描节点| C{条件形态}&#10;    C --&gt;|多列等值组合| D[考虑 mcv / dependencies]&#10;    C --&gt;|含函数或算术表达式| E[考虑表达式统计]&#10;    C --&gt;|范围条件| F[提高该列 statistics_target&lt;br/&gt;或接受直方图模型误差]&#10;    C --&gt;|LIKE / 正则 / 数组| G[无对应统计, 换索引方案]&#10;    B --&gt;|连接或聚合节点| H{基数来自列组?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[考虑 ndistinct]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[回查下层节点的传播误差]&#10;    D --&gt; K[CREATE STATISTICS + ANALYZE]&#10;    E --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[重新 EXPLAIN 对比同一查询]\">graph TD\n    A[EXPLAIN ANALYZE&lt;br/&gt;逐节点算 q-error] --&gt; B{q-error 最大的节点在哪一层?}\n    B --&gt;|叶子扫描节点| C{条件形态}\n    C --&gt;|多列等值组合| D[考虑 mcv / dependencies]\n    C --&gt;|含函数或算术表达式| E[考虑表达式统计]\n    C --&gt;|范围条件| F[提高该列 statistics_target&lt;br/&gt;或接受直方图模型误差]\n    C --&gt;|LIKE / 正则 / 数组| G[无对应统计, 换索引方案]\n    B --&gt;|连接或聚合节点| H{基数来自列组?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[考虑 ndistinct]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[回查下层节点的传播误差]\n    D --&gt; K[CREATE STATISTICS + ANALYZE]\n    E --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[重新 EXPLAIN 对比同一查询]</pre><p>除手工 EXPLAIN，两类工具把诊断常态化：<code>auto_explain</code> 在 <code>log_analyze = on</code> 时把超过 <code>log_min_duration</code> 的查询连同实际行数写进日志（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/auto-explain.html</code>）；<code>pg_stat_statements</code> 提供聚合执行统计但不含逐节点行数——两者配合才是&quot;找到跑得慢的查询 → 看它的估算错在哪&quot;。第三方 EXPLAIN 可视化站点（explain.dalibo.com 等）只渲染同一份 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code> 输出，不产生新数据：当展示层，不当证据源。</p>\n<p>诊断中最容易踩的两个坑：</p>\n<p><strong>一、参数化查询的&quot;平均选择率&quot;陷阱。</strong> 预处理语句（含 PL/pgSQL、多数 ORM 生成的查询）先按参数值生成定制计划，PG 在若干次执行后可能改用缓存中的<strong>通用计划</strong>（generic plan），其选择率按参数的<strong>平均分布</strong>估。对数据倾斜明显的列（例如 <code>shop_id</code>），通用计划会同时为&quot;大店&quot;和&quot;小店&quot;选同一计划，必有一方错。PG 12 起可用 <code>plan_cache_mode</code> 关闭这一行为（<code>SET plan_cache_mode = force_custom_plan;</code>，<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-query.html</code>）。若 q-error 只在同一查询换参数时剧烈起伏，先怀疑这里，而不是先建统计。</p>\n<p><strong>二、用 <code>enable_*</code> 开关&quot;修&quot;计划。</strong> <code>SET enable_seqscan = off</code> 强行让规划器选索引，只是把估算错误藏起来——既没修正统计，也会在数据量变化后失效，还会污染会话外的查询。正确的收敛路径是&quot;改统计 → 重新 ANALYZE → 用同一查询的 EXPLAIN 前后对照&quot;，把 <code>enable_*</code> 仅当诊断手段（验证&quot;如果走索引会不会更快&quot;这个假设），而非修复手段。</p>\n<p>最后一条纪律：<strong>扩展统计的效果只能通过对照观测</strong>。<code>pg_statistic_ext_data</code> 只存序列化摘要，不会告诉你&quot;修正了多少行&quot;。可验证做法是保留一份未建统计时的 <code>EXPLAIN</code>，建统计并 <code>ANALYZE</code> 后再跑同一查询，比较目标节点 q-error 与最终计划——若无实质下降就该删掉该统计对象，否则它只是给每次 <code>ANALYZE</code> 增加开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>规划器默认假设&quot;列间独立&quot;且&quot;只认识裸列&quot;，<code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 的 <code>dependencies</code> / <code>ndistinct</code> / <code>mcv</code>（PG 10/10/12）就是针对这两条的补丁；PG 14 把统计定义范围扩展到表达式。</li>\n<li><code>dependencies</code> 存方向性函数依赖度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，估行按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = s_1(d + (1-d)s_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 插值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为旧行为；<code>ndistinct</code> 修 <code>GROUP BY</code> 与连接基数，<code>mcv</code> 修多列高频<strong>组合</strong>频率。三者都<strong>只对等值条件</strong>生效，范围条件仍走单列直方图。</li>\n<li>表达式统计前身是表达式索引；PG 14 起可直接 <code>CREATE STATISTICS ... ON (expr)</code>，表达式必须 immutable、只能引用本表列，且要求查询<strong>逐字匹配</strong>该表达式。</li>\n<li><code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 只注册定义，<strong>必须重新 <code>ANALYZE</code></strong> 才有数据；每个统计对象可用 <code>ALTER STATISTICS ... SET STATISTICS</code>（PG 13+）单独设采样目标。</li>\n<li>诊断用 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code> 逐节点算 q-error 并<strong>自底向上</strong>归因，<code>auto_explain</code> + <code>pg_stat_statements</code> 负责常态化采集；参数化查询的通用计划平均选择率、用 <code>enable_*</code> 掩盖问题，是两个最常见的伪修复。</li>\n<li>扩展统计只有&quot;改统计 → ANALYZE → 同一查询前后对照&quot;这一条验证路径，无收益的统计对象应及时删除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"扩展统计、表达式统计与估算偏差诊断","id":"扩展统计-表达式统计与估算偏差诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类扩展统计与表达式的两种落地","id":"核心概念-三类扩展统计与表达式的两种落地"},{"level":2,"text":"dependencies：把函数依赖翻译成选择率折扣","id":"dependencies-把函数依赖翻译成选择率折扣"},{"level":2,"text":"ndistinct 与 mcv：分组基数与多列高频组合","id":"ndistinct-与-mcv-分组基数与多列高频组合"},{"level":2,"text":"表达式统计：从表达式索引到 PG 14 的扩展统计表达式","id":"表达式统计-从表达式索引到-pg-14-的扩展统计表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"估算偏差诊断：从 EXPLAIN 差异到归因路径","id":"估算偏差诊断-从-explain-差异到归因路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"选择率估算与代价模型代价参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/selectivity-cost-model"},"next":{"title":"路径枚举与动态规划搜索（RelOptInfo/add_path）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/plan-search-join/path-enumeration-dp"}}